        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moby Click</strong> is a cozy top-down harpoon shooter inspired by <i>Moby-Dick</i> and classic pixel games.<br>Command the Pequod, defend it from waves of sea creatures, earn doubloons, unlock upgrades, and push deeper into Ahab’s quest for the legendary White Whale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, satisfying naval combat</strong> — aim freely with mouse, controller, or Steam Deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-based arcade action</strong> — fend off escalating swarms of sharks, rays, leviathans, and monstrous bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep progression loop</strong> — earn doubloons for run upgrades and lore shards for permanent ship buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige into Ahab’s Obsession</strong> — reset for powerful bonuses and  rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Steam Deck supported</strong> — custom input layout, tuned UI, optimized controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face storms, night seas, and increasingly bizarre denizens of the deep as you push toward the inevitable showdown with the <strong>White Whale</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moby Click</strong> is a cozy top-down harpoon shooter inspired by <i>Moby-Dick</i> and classic pixel games.<br>Command the Pequod, defend it from waves of sea creatures, earn doubloons, unlock upgrades, and push deeper into Ahab’s quest for the legendary White Whale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, satisfying naval combat</strong> — aim freely with mouse, controller, or Steam Deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wave-based arcade action</strong> — fend off escalating swarms of sharks, rays, leviathans, and monstrous bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep progression loop</strong> — earn doubloons for run upgrades and lore shards for permanent ship buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prestige into Ahab’s Obsession</strong> — reset for powerful bonuses and  rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Steam Deck supported</strong> — custom input layout, tuned UI, optimized controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face storms, night seas, and increasingly bizarre denizens of the deep as you push toward the inevitable showdown with the <strong>White Whale</strong>.</p>",
